qbr-2024-Q3.md

Meridian Supply Co. reported Q3 2024 revenue of $8,461,842 from 5,579 orders, with gross margin at 33.1% and 102,433 units shipped, representing a 4.8% increase versus the prior quarter. The Southwest was the strongest region at $2,607,943 and the Midwest the weakest at $1,061,883, while Safety was the top category by revenue at $2,663,774. The quarter was affected by the loss of Halloway Group, the Midwest’s largest account by revenue, and the business expects demand to hold at current levels into the next quarter.

